632 0 obj
  << /ActualText (rebecnorth\100gmail\056com \267 516\267996\2676064 \267 rebeccanorth\056me\n\nGrowth Product Manager specializing in acquisition\054 activation\054 and retention for consumer subscription products\054 with a track record of scaling growth through PLG\054 experimentation\054 and 0 to 1 launches\056 A heavy AI practitioner who uses it daily\054 from writing specs and analyzing data to prototyping and shipping internal tools\056\n\nMicrosoft \267 Product Manager 2 \055 M365 \046 Copilot Subscriber Growth\nMay 2025 \055 Present \057 New York\054 NY\nDrive end\055to\055end growth strategy for Consumer M365 and Copilot experiences that improve retention and increased subscriber growth by 20\045 YoY to date\056 Own the checkout experience\054 optimizing conversion across the purchase funnel\056 Revamp the MVP trial journey to improve activation and boost paid conversion rates\054 while building a scalable framework for rapid experimentation\056 Launched a 0\055\055\0761 EDU SKU to test new market segments\054 unlocking 500K new subscribers annually\056 \n\nMicrosoft \267 Product Manager 2 \055 First Run Experiences\nSep 2022 \055 April 2025 \057 New York\054 NY\nOwned the top\055of\055funnel acquisition for M365\054 redesigned the Windows onboarding to increase subscriptions and LTV\056 Built new infrastructure to accelerate experimentation velocity\054 which enabled faster validation of growth hypotheses\056 Scaled engagement strategy that grew free desktop app MAU by 7\045 across Word\054 Excel\054 and PowerPoint\056\n \nMicrosoft \267 Product Manager\nSep 2020 \055 Aug 2022 \057 Redmond\054 WA\nLaunched and optimized growth experiments across M365 FRE offer pages\056 Improved UX\054 which increased consumer subscriptions by 14\045\056 Redesigned Windows 11 acquisition flows\054 increasing paid activation rates by 10\045\056\n\nMicrosoft \267 Program Manager Intern\nJune 2019 \055 Aug 2019 \057 Redmond\054 WA\nLed a team of engineers and designers to create a personalized Office upsell experience\054 in the Windows onboarding process by utilizing user intent\056\n\nSiriusXM \267 Customer Retention Marketing Intern\nJune 2018 \055 Aug 2018 \057 New York\054 NY\nAnalyzed data to strategically develop tactical campaigns to retain current users\056 Used competitive analysis research to improve streaming app and gain subscribers\056 \n\nCornell University \267 B\056S\056 Information Science\nAug 2016 \055 Dec 2019 \057 Ithaca\054 NY\nConcentration\072 UX\nMinors\072 Business\054 Design \046 Environmental Analysis\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 4 ]
